## 4. Escalation handlers reachable from this pipeline

Escalation YAMLs live in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/officefloor/escalation/` and each maps an exception type to a handler class. All are one-liners of the form `handle: { class: ...Handler }`. The ones the POST /api/owners steps can trigger:

| Thrown by step | Exception YAML | Handler class | HTTP status |
|---|---|---|---|
| composition `authorize:` denial | `org.springframework.security.authorization.AuthorizationDeniedException.yml` | `ForbiddenExceptionHandler` | 403 |
| checkIdempotency | `...IdempotentReplayException.yml` | `IdempotentReplayExceptionHandler` | 200 (replay) |
| validate | `...MissingOwnerFieldsException.yml` | `MissingOwnerFieldsExceptionHandler` | 400 |
| validatePostcode | `...InvalidPostcodeException.yml` | `InvalidPostcodeExceptionHandler` | 400 |
| validateRegistrationDate | `...FutureRegistrationDateException.yml` | `FutureRegistrationDateExceptionHandler` | 400 |
| normalizeTelephone | `...InvalidTelephoneException.yml` | `InvalidTelephoneExceptionHandler` | 400 |
| normalizeEmail | `...InvalidEmailException.yml` | `InvalidEmailExceptionHandler` | 400 |
| rejectDisposableEmail | `...DisposableEmailDomainException.yml` | `DisposableEmailDomainExceptionHandler` | 400 |
| ensureCityCapacity | `...CityAtCapacityException.yml` | `CityAtCapacityExceptionHandler` | 409 |
| ensureDailyLimit | `...DailyLimitReachedException.yml` | `DailyLimitReachedExceptionHandler` | 429 |
| ensureUniqueIdentity | `...DuplicateIdentityException.yml` | `DuplicateIdentityExceptionHandler` | 409 |
| (global bean-validation) | `org.springframework.web.bind.MethodArgumentNotValidException.yml` | `ValidationExceptionHandler` | 400 |

Also present but not triggered by these specific steps: `NotFoundException`, `DataIntegrityViolationException`, `java.lang.Exception` (generic fallback).

Handler classes are under `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/escalation/`. Each `service`→`handle(@Parameter <Exception> ex, ObjectResponse<ResponseEntity<ProblemDetail>> response)` builds an RFC-7807 `ProblemDetail` via the shared `ProblemDetails.build(...)`.

Exception classes (data carriers), verbatim key parts:

- **IdempotentReplayException** (`extends Exception`) carries `int ownerId`; handler loads that owner and returns 200 with its `OwnerDto`:
  ```java
